Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:19:06 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] silent-start-hud

When a game starts with the device muted or at zero volume, the volume
HUD shows once as play begins, so a silent game is not taken for a
broken core. Not while the cart is loading, and not again on a wake
from a doze; the next insert shows it again. From jgraving/slot
12f7b3a (GPL-3.0),
https://github.com/jgraving/slot/commit/12f7b3a
